    "body": "Review findings addressed (9d0527a) and #78's review fixes merged in (b7aa6d2); quick gate green:\n- an off-centre hole's mouth sits where the drill's edge nearest the axis meets the raw surface; the proof checks the drill's full width (and a wider shank) down the hole line - edge at the approach's end r19.792 (inside the r20 bar) -> r20.956;\n- the end-face swing clears max(d, shank)/2 (3 mm drill on a 6 mm shank: z 21.6 -> 23.1 over the z20 face);\n- a hole pointing away from the spindle is refused by name (#78's earlier check now catches it first; the test matches its wording);\n- the end-face check runs first (the old proof refused every raw-stock opposite pair);\n- tests: STOCK_R + d/2, a 40x40 box stock, an off-origin spindle with wider raw stock, the stale refusal asserted by text; drilling_cross_stock 8.\nHolder sweep on the swing -> #84; box corner-radius air drilling -> #85.",
